273
00:11:36,870 --> 00:11:38,820
which we know we have with AI.

274
00:11:38,820 --> 00:11:41,280
And so, with that, we were able to do that,

275
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:44,010
and what the analytics showed us

276
00:11:44,010 --> 00:11:49,010
was that confusion was lived by students.

277
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:53,340
And through this pilot, we were able to take those analytics

278
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:56,010
and determine what those pain points were

279
00:11:56,010 --> 00:11:58,920
and kind of alleviate that issue.

280
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,920
And then it was really very...

281
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:05,010
We used it for our child development

282
00:12:05,010 --> 00:12:06,990
Spanish-speaking cohort,

283
00:12:06,990 --> 00:12:08,850
which there's a lot of confusion

