00:12:16,140 --> 00:12:18,270
What is APA? How do I..."

287
00:12:18,270 --> 00:12:21,213
All these little type of confusion points.

288
00:12:22,590 --> 00:12:24,597
And so that was the basis of this pilot,

289
00:12:24,597 --> 00:12:27,030
and we did it with the one cohort.

290
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:30,180
And so when we're talking about where our voices

