00:34:37,440 --> 00:34:38,970
Why are you in this course?

819
00:34:38,970 --> 00:34:42,750
What are you trying to achieve of being in this course?

820
00:34:42,750 --> 00:34:44,970
If it's as simple as you just wanna put in a prompt

821
00:34:44,970 --> 00:34:47,490
to write your five-page paper for you and hit Submit,

822
00:34:47,490 --> 00:34:49,110
what did you learn from that experience

823
00:34:49,110 --> 00:34:52,320
besides how to put a prompt into ChatGPT, type the paper,

824
00:34:52,320 --> 00:34:54,030
and hit the Submit button?

825
00:34:54,030 --> 00:34:55,980
So getting back to the why of learning,

826
00:34:55,980 --> 00:34:57,870
and that's something that really excites me

827
00:34:57,870 --> 00:34:59,430
about this AI future

828
00:34:59,430 --> 00:35:02,160
is just bringing that why back to teaching and learning.

829
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:04,830
Because sometimes, we lose track of that lens.

830
00:35:04,830 --> 00:35:07,440
So why are you taking Geography 101?

831
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:09,120
Oh, is it just a general education?

832
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:10,530
Are you interested in this topic?

833
00:35:10,530 --> 00:35:12,000
Do you wanna be a geographer?

834
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:15,180
Do you want to go into advanced GIS mapping someday?

835
00:35:15,180 --> 00:35:16,140
If you do,

836
00:35:16,140 --> 00:35:18,387
here's the steps that you need to take to get there.

837
00:35:18,387 --> 00:35:20,970
And I can tell you, submitting it into AI

