00:35:25,620 --> 00:35:28,050
So, getting back to the why with our students, I think,

841
00:35:28,050 --> 00:35:30,720
is important to make sure we stay centered

842
00:35:30,720 --> 00:35:31,833
and connected to that.

843
00:35:32,940 --> 00:35:34,100
- And to me it's...

844
00:35:35,190 --> 00:35:38,010
I think we're all a little allergic to change,

845
00:35:38,010 --> 00:35:39,960
and especially sudden change like this happened,

846
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:41,940
it was all of a sudden here,

