916
00:38:43,230 --> 00:38:45,810
So when dealing with new technologies,

917
00:38:45,810 --> 00:38:48,690
how do we consider the humans in the room,

918
00:38:48,690 --> 00:38:50,070
faculty and students alike?

919
00:38:50,070 --> 00:38:53,400
So we heard earlier when the chancellor spoke

