934
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:39,780
And so that's one of the biggest things

935
00:39:39,780 --> 00:39:41,490
that I got from this.

936
00:39:41,490 --> 00:39:45,510
And then the faculty are then teaching,

937
00:39:45,510 --> 00:39:47,190
get the focus on the people

938
00:39:47,190 --> 00:39:48,960
because those little tiny questions,

939
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:51,570
those confusions are taken out of the equation

