944
00:40:05,220 --> 00:40:07,650
not chase housekeeping emails."

945
00:40:07,650 --> 00:40:09,540
And so I hope that resonates

946
00:40:09,540 --> 00:40:12,360
because that's exactly what it did for him,

947
00:40:12,360 --> 00:40:15,810
and therefore the students got a better experience,

948
00:40:15,810 --> 00:40:17,100
and we're talking about English

949
00:40:17,100 --> 00:40:18,570
as a Second Language students.

950
00:40:18,570 --> 00:40:20,700
And so it was just...

951
00:40:20,700 --> 00:40:23,553
It was really neat to see, so.

952
00:40:25,470 --> 00:40:26,303
- And then,

953
00:40:28,170 --> 00:40:29,930
for me, it's also about...

954
00:40:30,900 --> 00:40:32,820
There's a learning curve, like with every technology,

955
00:40:32,820 --> 00:40:34,827
with really anything, there's a learning curve,

956
00:40:34,827 --> 00:40:35,660
and there might be

957
00:40:35,660 --> 00:40:37,740
a really steep learning curve in some cases.

958
00:40:37,740 --> 00:40:40,170
So let's acknowledge that from the start

959
00:40:40,170 --> 00:40:42,063
and bring people up to speed,

960
00:40:43,380 --> 00:40:44,430
everyone to the same level,

961
00:40:44,430 --> 00:40:48,810
not just those who already have a lot of knowledge in this.

962
00:40:48,810 --> 00:40:50,010
And some of us have been playing with this

963
00:40:50,010 --> 00:40:52,920
since a few years now or a few years now,

964
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:56,670
and we are able to perhaps just get there faster.

