It's not just our students,

986
00:41:53,283 --> 00:41:55,380
it's really our community that needs to learn

987
00:41:55,380 --> 00:41:57,363
how to be brought up to speed on this.

988
00:41:58,530 --> 00:41:59,760
- Well said to both of them.

989
00:41:59,760 --> 00:42:02,250
The only piece I would add is just simply,

990
00:42:02,250 --> 00:42:05,460
