00:42:40,920 --> 00:42:43,920
Where do you get taken away from doing more tasks

1010
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:47,010
that are maybe a simple email response to students

1011
00:42:47,010 --> 00:42:50,160
in terms of, as we saw with our students skit this morning,

