00:43:03,420 --> 00:43:05,310
Therefore, me as the faculty member,

1019
00:43:05,310 --> 00:43:06,570
it opens up my time

1020
00:43:06,570 --> 00:43:09,630
to work on some of the more complex conversations

1021
00:43:09,630 --> 00:43:11,760
to help my students' deeper understanding

1022
00:43:11,760 --> 00:43:14,250
of any sort of topic, whatever it may be.

1023
00:43:14,250 --> 00:43:15,360
So think through that,

1024
00:43:15,360 --> 00:43:17,853
embrace technology where it's at its best.

1025
00:43:20,340 --> 00:43:24,150
- I would just add working with the students

1026
00:43:24,150 --> 00:43:27,720
to consider marginalized voices,

1027
00:43:27,720 --> 00:43:29,419
especially to the extent that AI

1028
00:43:29,419 --> 00:43:32,670
