1029
00:43:32,670 --> 00:43:34,440
Not talking about your own chat bot right now,

1030
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:38,040
I'm just talking about generic ChatGPT or what have you,

1031
00:43:38,040 --> 00:43:40,860
that it may be giving a very homogenized.

