00:43:40,860 --> 00:43:42,270
Is that a word, homogenized?

1033
00:43:42,270 --> 00:43:44,970
Homogenized viewpoint

1034
00:43:44,970 --> 00:43:48,060
or simply giving you a middle-of-the-road perspective,

1035
00:43:48,060 --> 00:43:51,420
which might be a very white Eurocentric perspective,

1036
00:43:51,420 --> 00:43:52,650
or it might not be.

